.
.  Generate sample output for Fatigue-Life PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na flpdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Fatigue Life PDF (Gamma = 2)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT FLPDF(X,2) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp FLPDF.PS flpdf.ps
system rm FLPDF.PS
.
quit
